      "created_at": "2013-04-30T00:23:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes you have gotten it correct. Ra would get a total of 6 damage from Elemental Storm while Bunker would of taken nothing. If they continue to get any other increases it gets even more nasty. Say an Obsidian Field was in play, Ra would than take 9, Bunker would take 3, and any hero not Ra and doesn't have reduction would take 6.</p>",
